["transition","LNGHZN-S2-T3",1784326251,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~1",{"to":"done","outcome":"Added comprehensive documentation of arm ready --waves to the armature-coordinator skill's parallel-dispatch.md reference. Documented --waves as the engine-computed alternative to manual scope-disjoint reasoning, explicitly noting that the advisory wave output does not replace the existing prose-recorded wave manifest step (WAVE_TASK_IDS/WAVE_BASE_SHA), which remains required and unchanged. Emphasized the contract-safety limitation: --waves guarantees file-level scope disjointness only, not freedom from shared-contract drift, so the post-wave Parallel Branch Overlap Audit remains mandatory per ADR 0012."}]
