["transition","LNGHZN-S10-T1",1786750005,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~1",{"to":"done","outcome":"Made two-tier gate model, bounded review, and effort defaults normative in docs/agents/workflow.md and the worker/coordinator/reviewer SKILL.md files: worker MUST NOT run full gate on intermediate remediations (full gate once at final task head); coordinator runs bounded review protocol (1 comprehensive review, parallel perspectives aggregated, 1 consolidated remediation, 1 hard-scoped confirmation, 3-cycle cap then escalate to human per I7) plus medium/high effort defaults and transcript-free dispatch; reviewer accepts gate criteria only from citable evidence (exit=0, profile=full, SHA==bundle head) and returns rating+findings in chat with full assessment JSON referenced by path under .armature/review/. make validate-skills passed cleanly. PR: https://github.com/scullxbones/armature/pull/100"}]
