["decision","LNGHZN-S10-T3",1786763142,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~1",{"topic":"evidence-op-storage","choice":"new gate-evidence op type in gate_evidence.go with dedicated payload, not types.go Payload fields","rationale":"Scope lists gate_evidence.go not types.go; census extracts Op constants only from types.go; materialize has no handler in scope so a types.go constant would force a census row without a no-op handler. Dedicated payload keeps parse/append in-package. Follow-up: register a no-op materialize handler when a later task can touch engine.go."}]
