["decision","LNGHZN-S10-T3",1786763423,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~1",{"topic":"registration-and-bundle-field","choice":"touch main.go, review/types.go, and review.go in addition to listed scope","rationale":"arm gate cannot exist without newGateCmd registration in main.go (census-drift-check requires the command). ReviewBundle cannot include citable evidence without a GateEvidence field on the struct (types.go) and prepare-time AttachGateEvidence (review.go). No other out-of-scope files."}]
